---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About | Framelab"
  description="Framelab is a set of free video tools that run entirely in your browser: no upload, no watermark, no sign-up and no limits. Built by Arpan Mandal."
>
  <article class="container prose">
    <h1>About Framelab</h1>
    <p>Framelab is a set of free video tools that run entirely in your browser. There is no upload, no watermark, no sign-up and no limit on length, size or daily use.</p>
    <p>
      It uses WebCodecs, the media engine built into modern browsers, through the open-source <a href="https://github.com/Vanilagy/mediabunny">Mediabunny</a> library.
      Because the work happens on your device, it is as private as it is fast.
    </p>
    <p>Framelab works in recent versions of Chrome, Edge, Safari and Firefox.</p>
    <p>See the <a href="/licenses">licences</a> for the open-source software it is built with.</p>
    <p class="muted">© Arpan Mandal. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 70ch;
    padding-top: var(--space-6);
  }
</style>
